Problme:
  Build prefix sum and find sum by using range at O(1) time complexity.

Approach:

  By using prefix sum that precompute sum of all element in the array from begining up to each index.
  Calculate Sum:
    prefix[index] = prefix[i-1] + nums[i]
  Range sum:
    Range[l,r] = prefix[r] - prefix[l-1]

Example;

  input:
  int nums[] = {10,20,30,40,50}
  Range[1,3] = 100 - 10 

  output:
  Range of sum is: 90

Time complexity:
  O(n) to calculate prefix sum

Space complexity:
  O(n) to create prefix sum array

